's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"69fff84eefb1f76ed211a99396e2c44b","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"151ec30e9656f6ac62580958b876f159","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"9a4a71f7880258f630225ff04ea18446","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"67cb466e43a22d2b8167a60b2adbb0a5","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"92928e14dc6d00abb7a2a33d129b0c68","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"6cd01ca194efb63611cbe56b31183ef3","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"bfb0a7ee7c9b851403193aa937eb3abd","originalFileName":"67d46b40-fe10-4ce4-b264-163589243744-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"log","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":68},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"87ba9d71ac0710fed454e36426459345","